(card "exp:C7.3_top3_rolling_baserate" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:C7.3_top3_rolling_baserate"
  :body "---\nnav: 13\ntype: experiment\nid: C7.3\nshort_name: top3_rolling_baserate\ntitle: \"C7.3 — top-3 + ticker rolling base-rate N=30 cold-start n<3\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: c\nround: r7\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_c__no_open3min]]\"\ntrain_nav: 2.5148\ntrain_trade_count: 141\ntrain_win_rate: 0.9078\ntrain_sharpe: 9.1428\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0047\nval_nav_mean: 1.0732\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0764\nval_window_count: 13\ntest_nav: null\ntest_trade_count: null\ntest_sharpe: null\ntest_win_rate: null\ntest_max_drawdown: null\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: challenger\noutcome: no_test_run\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 0\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [whitelist]\npast_only_window_days: 30\nwarmup_required: 3\ncreated: 2026-05-17T01:30:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/c, round/r7, axis/whitelist, status/challenger, outcome/no_test_run, leak/clean, size/medium]\n---\n\n# C7.3 — top-3 + ticker rolling base-rate N=30 cold-start n<3\n\n> **TL;DR** —— R7 alt 路线：在 top-3 base 上加 **per-ticker 过去 30d 滚动 win-rate gate**（≥0.4 阈值，warmup n<3 时直接 admit）。train NAV 2.51 与 baseline_C6.4 几乎 tie，**未触发明显额外 NAV gain** —— per-ticker base-rate 信号被 top-3 自身的 leg-level signal 吃掉了。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- 假设：per-ticker 历史 30d win-rate 提供额外信号；admit 只 ticker 历史 win 率好的 leg。\n- 期待：trade_count 略降（剔除冷 ticker），NAV 升。\n- 实测：trade_count 141（vs baseline 142, 仅 -1），NAV 2.515 vs 2.511 (+0.16%) —— 改动太小，没真正生效。\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- 主脚本：`/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_c/scripts/round_7_runner.py`\n- 步骤：\n  1. top-3 expand (baseline_C6.4)\n  2. 对每 leg ticker 计算 trigger 时刻前 30d 的 rolling win-rate\n  3. 若 sub-sample n ≥ 3 且 win-rate < 0.40 → drop leg\n  4. n < 3 → admit (cold-start fallback)\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- ticker 30d 滚动 win-rate 严格 past-only (events 中 `event_time < t & event_time >= t-30d`)。\n- warmup n<3 即不足 3 样本 → admit (避免冷 ticker 被一律砍)。\n- critic audit pass。`#leak/clean`。\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 2.5148 | 141 | 9.14 | 90.8% | -0.47% |\n| Val (rolling 13w) | 1.0732 ± 0.076 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | NOT RUN | - | - | - | - |\n| **Δ vs baseline_C6.4** | +0.004 | -1 | +0.09 | +0.6pp | 0 |\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score = 0。\n- 真实 risk：mechanism 几乎 NO-OP（只砍掉 1 笔）。要么 warmup n<3 太宽容，要么 ticker base-rate 信号本身弱。\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **derived_from**: [[arc_260516a__team_c__baseline_C6.4__top3_expand]]\n- **alt_route_for**: [[arc_260516a__team_c__C7.5__top3_no_open3min]] (R7 同 round 不同 axis)\n- **dominated_by**: [[arc_260516a__team_c__C7.5__top3_no_open3min]] (NAV +0.51 高)\n- **competes_with**: [[arc_260516a__team_b__B-R9-1__rolling_baserate]] (B 队相同 axis 不同 base)\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_c/output/cross_round_leaderboard.csv` (C7.3)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- 这条 axis (per-ticker rolling base-rate) 在 arc 260516a 的 trade pool 上**信号弱到难辨**。下次类似 axis 应：\n  1. 降低 warmup 阈值 (n<3 → n<2)，让 mechanism 更激进\n  2. 调阈值 (0.40 → 0.50/0.55)，提高 cutoff\n  3. 配合 trade_count 充足的 base (>= 200 笔)，否则 ticker-level statistics 太稀疏\n"
  :path "experiments/arc_260516a__team_c__C7.3__top3_rolling_baserate.md"
  :source_mtime "2026-05-17T10:25:07+08:00"
